## What We Are Building

SandyStudio = AI animation studio. This session was a long live-run support session for **E16 «Sandy in The Gym»** (which SHIPPED — final cut DONE). Work split into UI features (Key Art drawer, per-shot kebab process view, Episode Settings retry-caps + budget defaults) and architecture diagnosis (pipeline gate-inconsistency, canon-staleness). All shipped code landed on `claude/e13-thin-agent-run` and was MERGED to master at end (`996e31d`).

North-Star context: Mode-3 autonomous factory. The recurring theme of E16's friction = the pipeline treats APPROVED as an independent latch, decoupled from whether its gate was truly met and whether its inputs still hold → needs human nudges. The freshness/reconciler layer that would close this EXISTS but is inert (`MECHANICS_AUTO_ADVANCE` off) and incomplete.

