## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **Key Art drawer (Fix 1b + Fix 3)** — commit `64ba90b`. IMG-thumbnail 3-concept gallery via CandidatesStrip + per-variant approve/revoke + Edit-plan button (EditorModal on linked SPC-thumb_plan). Confirmed: tsc·0, 1145/1145 tests.
- **Per-shot kebab → two-field process view** — commit `1b3a0a6`. AnimaticPlayer popover = two fields (Image / Video), each with own designer-plan → critic → artifact sub-chain; two-directional approve/снять tick on every line; critic verdict chips; reference generate/regen button; video-version click → wide drawer; NONE removed; object-aware "generating…" badges. Confirmed live on :3000 (Director saw it after hard-refresh) + tsc·0/1145. NOTE: first attempt was a 4-partition layout (Design/Critic/Image/Video) — Director rejected it live («порядок не очень»), reworked to two-field.
- **Retry-caps in Episode Settings** — commit `3c37e96`. Three per-episode caps via episodes.metadata (mirrors concierge_cap_usd): prompt_revision_cap (2, → applyCriticVerdict cap at 4 runner sites), reference_regen_cap (2, → EREF loop maxRetries), video_regen_cap (1, → exec-vgen dedup now count-based). Byte-identical at defaults. tsc·0/1145.
- **Episode-create budget/cap defaults as real hard limits** — commit `d82df7d`. POST /api/episodes now writes budget_ceiling (series ?? 150) + metadata {concierge 30, retry 2/2/1} at INSERT. Closed the gap where $150/$30 were UI-prefill only (null budget = unlimited until manual Save). tsc·0/1145.
- **MERGE to master** — `git branch -f master … && git push origin master`. master fast-forwarded `2e0c79f → 996e31d`, pushed to origin. Working tree untouched (WIP preserved). Confirmed by push output `2e0c79f..996e31d master -> master`.
- **E16 FINAL CUT DONE** — Director confirmed. The EXEC-EREF stall was pure canon-staleness; unblocked by ONE manual command to Polina «approve the new plans».

