## What Has NOT Been Tried Yet (queued TD)

- **Canon-as-tracked-input invariant (q15, the big one):** the freshness engine (`input-versions.ts` UPSTREAM_BY_AGENT = only VANIM/VGEN artifact edges) has NO ref_plan←Bible-canon edge — canon is never a versioned input, so staleness is structurally blind to canon changes. Fix: stamp `input_versions.canon` = shot's LOCATION canon ROSTER (not just referenced slugs — roster is what catches SH16) at EXEC-EREF-DESIGNER write; state-matrix drift → REVISION «canon updated». Rides on the reconciler (inert behind MECHANICS_AUTO_ADVANCE) → do at clean-episode start.
- **gate-verified promotion:** approving the last critic review (REV-world_check) should promote the reviewed artifact (STB→APPROVED). Closes the «storyboard approval skipped → EREF gate fail (found 0 APPROVED)» bug.
- **casting-interview SKILL for Polina + Brief→Casting auto-nudge:** approved plan in `~/.claude/plans/glistening-drifting-biscuit.md` (BUT that file now holds the kebab plan — casting plan is in an earlier ExitPlanMode block + [[backlog_2026-07-05_live-run-queue]]). Casting has no executor (ART-AD spec-only) → stalls after brief. Skill = flavor:process, applies_when.agent:[EXEC-CONC], reuse setBibleContent/enrichBible/markAwaitingDirector/castEpisode.
- **cell-pulse bug:** timeline cell goes DIM after designer FINISHES (should be BRIGHT — dim was pre-start; finishing = plan exists). Same AnimaticPlayer cellPalette/liveWork fallback. Small fix.
- **Mode-3 fanout-critics not auto-starting** — UNVERIFIED («проверь потом»). May be false alarm; ref critic SHOULD chain via exec-eref-designer.ts:50-62.
- **canon UNLOCK button** (LOCKED SBL canons have no Unlock in Library) + **MECHANICS_AUTO_ADVANCE smoke** (reconciler built, never smoked; start from clean episode w/ reserved pilots) — Director-added backlog.

