## Decisions Made

- **Kebab = two fields (Image/Video) each with own designer+critic** — not 4 type-partitions (Director live-review rejected type-grouping).
- **Compact two-directional tick (✓/снять) per line** — not full PilotApproveButtons cluster (popover density). Critic line gets its own approve too (q11).
- **video_regen_cap = new dedicated cap in exec-vgen dedup gate** — NOT overloading SHOT_REGEN_CAP (shared w/ EREF, runaway semantics, default 6). Count-based; identical to old boolean at default 1.
- **Episode defaults written at CREATION** (not UI-prefill) — budget_ceiling ?? 150, metadata caps — sourced from env/config readers, no magic numbers.
- **Canon-staleness = systemic (canon-as-input), NOT a skill-rule patch** — reuse existing input_versions/reconciler; reject Polina's slug-scan (misses SH16).
- **Merge via `git branch -f master` (no checkout)** — to avoid disturbing the uncommitted WIP working tree; ff-only (verified master is ancestor).

